\title "Boil Them Cabbage Down"
\subtitle "Traditional Appalachian · standard 5-string banjo (Open G)"
\copyright "Traditional public-domain melody (Appalachian fiddle / banjo tune, pre-1900). Arrangement under MIT or Apache-2.0."
\tempo 100
\tuning D4 B3 G3 D3 G4
.
// A Part — "Boil them cabbage down, down"
:8 0.3 0.5 0.2 0.5 | 0.2 0.5 0.1 0.5 |
:8 2.3 0.5 0.3 0.5 | 0.3 0.5 0.3 0.5 |
:8 0.3 0.5 0.2 0.5 | 0.2 0.5 0.1 0.5 |
:8 2.3 0.5 0.3 0.5 | 0.3 0.5 0.3 0.5 |
// B Part — "Turn them hoecakes round, round"
:8 0.2 0.5 0.2 0.5 | 0.1 0.5 2.2 0.5 |
:8 0.2 0.5 2.3 0.5 | 0.3 0.5 0.3 0.5 |
:8 0.3 0.5 0.2 0.5 | 0.2 0.5 0.1 0.5 |
:8 2.3 0.5 0.3 0.5 | 0.3 0.5 0.3 0.5 |
